            Content: Hello, semantic world. This is a minimal valid STF document.
        Text
            Type: Text
            Content: It has a Context block (metadata) and a Page (content). Every object has an ObjectName, a Type, and a Role.
    Section
        Type: Section
        Role: Content
        Text
            Type: Text
            Content: Trust is structural: mark untrusted visitor content with Origin, and keep it inside a UserData zone so it can never carry executable Control properties.
